# .ignore — what search tools skip in addition to .gitignore. ripgrep and fd read it.
# These files are committed, so .gitignore can't list them, but a match inside one is
# noise for a person and wasted context for an agent. To search them anyway: rg -u
*.min.js
*.min.css
*.map
pnpm-lock.yaml
package-lock.json
uv.lock
Cargo.lock
